      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "notes\n\nHandle sensor failures (stuck sensors, offline sensors) gracefully\n\nHistorical analytics — peak hours, average occupancy by zone, seasonal patterns\n\nScale & Constraints:\n50,000 sensors × 2 updates/min = 100K events/minute\nLatency: availability updated within 5 seconds of sensor change\nReliability: 5% of sensors are offline at any time (stale data handling)\nGeospatial: H3 or geohash indexing for zone-level aggregation\nStorage: 2 years of historical occupancy data for trend analysis",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "notes\n\nHandle sensor failures (stuck sensors, offline sensors) gracefully\n\nHistorical analytics — peak hours, average occupancy by zone, seasonal patterns\n\nScale & Constraints:\n50,000 sensors × 2 updates/min = 100K events/minute\nLatency: availability updated within 5 seconds of sensor change\nReliability: 5% of sensors are offline at any time (stale data handling)\nGeospatial: H3 or geohash indexing for zone-level aggregation\nStorage: 2 years of historical occupancy data for trend analysis",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
